1659
01:08:06.007 --> 01:08:09.576
Yes, and the . . . and get everything carted out and all, yes.

1660
01:08:09.576 --> 01:08:10.550
Labeled and all.

1661
01:08:10.550 --> 01:08:12.497
<v ARSENEAULT>How long did you work there?

1662
01:08:12.497 --> 01:08:13.470
<v LEE>Only a year.

1663
01:08:13.470 --> 01:08:19.960
Because as I said before I went . . . That summer before I went off to Wisconsin, Rich and I became engaged.

1664
01:08:19.960 --> 01:08:26.775
And we had set our date to get married the following year in June, possibly on the first day of summer.

1665
01:08:26.775 --> 01:08:30.669
And it was actually that June twenty . . . I mean June twenty-first, 1969.

1666
01:08:30.669 --> 01:08:37.483
