1667
01:08:37.483 --> 01:08:41.053
and where he would settle and so we weren’t too sure.

1668
01:08:41.053 --> 01:08:41.377
<v ARSENEAULT>Wow.

1669
01:08:41.377 --> 01:08:43.000
<v LEE>So there we were.

1670
01:08:43.000 --> 01:08:43.291
<v ARSENEAULT>Wow.

1671
