1689
01:09:24.377 --> 01:09:25.252
<v LEE>Oh my God.

1690
01:09:25.252 --> 01:09:27.000
<v HOLMAN>Before he could marry her . . .

1691
01:09:27.000 --> 01:09:27.877
<v LEE>Oh my, God.

