1697
01:09:34.311 --> 01:09:34.604
<v LEE>Okay.

1698
01:09:34.604 --> 01:09:35.189
Yes, yes.

1699
01:09:35.189 --> 01:09:39.283
He had to . . . he said . . . I said, “Well he had to paint the room.”

