1705
01:09:49.811 --> 01:09:50.104
<v ARSENEAULT>Wow.

1706
01:09:50.104 --> 01:09:51.566
<v LEE>He did all of that.

1707
01:09:51.566 --> 01:09:54.491
That . . . as I told you, he was in industrial arts.

1708
01:09:54.491 --> 01:09:54.783
Yeah.

1709
01:09:54.783 --> 01:09:55.075
<v ARSENEAULT>Wow.

1710
01:09:55.075 --> 01:09:58.000
So he asked your dad, got on a knee?

1711
01:09:58.000 --> 01:09:58.344
<v LEE>Yeah.

1712
01:09:58.344 --> 01:10:00.406
<v ARSENEAULT>And it was probably eye level . . .

1713
01:10:00.406 --> 01:10:00.750
<v LEE>Yeah!

