01:10:00.750 --> 01:10:02.812
And my dad was like, “Wow.

1715
01:10:02.812 --> 01:10:03.156
Alright.”

1716
01:10:03.156 --> 01:10:07.625
And he would always tell the other sons in law, “Hey,” you know?

1717
01:10:07.625 --> 01:10:12.438
I guess Dad . . . I mean eight girls and having to marry them all off?

1718
01:10:12.438 --> 01:10:12.781
<v ARSENEAULT>Yeah.

1719
01:10:12.781 --> 01:10:13.812
<v LEE>Oh my goodness.

1720
01:10:13.812 --> 01:10:14.500
So yes.

1721
01:10:14.500 --> 01:10:15.188
That . . . He [. . .?].

1722
