1787
01:11:50.636 --> 01:11:51.727
<v LEE>When she bent . . . Yeah.

1788
01:11:51.727 --> 01:11:54.455
When she bent, her legs were up like this . . . Yes.

1789
01:11:54.455 --> 01:11:55.000
<v ARSENEAULT>Wow.

1790
01:11:55.000 --> 01:11:55.360
<v LEE>Amazing.

